  ✓ Stage 4: audit claim adequacy, real-program pinning, satisfiable preconditions, and concrete substitutions
  ✓ Stage 5: inventory and review every syntax/function/semantic/proof rule with witnesses for any unsoundness
  ✓ Stage 6: build and run a fresh meaningful false-postcondition mutation
  ✓ Stage 7: account for proven versus assumed facts and write the final seven-stage REVIEW.md
